WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:03.420
Maria keeps the passwords her son will need in

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.167
one place.

3
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.403
On save it is sealed with a key that belongs

4
00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:13.512
to Maria alone.

5
00:00:14.217 --> 00:00:16.166
She opens it for a minute.

6
00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:18.202
Then it hides itself again.

7
00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:22.676
And every look is on record, hers included.

8
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:29.546
Sam, her son, opens his mother's plan from his

9
00:00:29.546 --> 00:00:30.795
own account.

10
00:00:31.202 --> 00:00:34.472
Sam sees only the Wi-Fi, the one secret Maria

11
00:00:34.472 --> 00:00:35.928
shared with him now.

12
00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:39.968
He opens it, and Maria's log gets a line with his name.

13
00:00:42.307 --> 00:00:45.756
Someone with database access copies one sealed

14
00:00:45.756 --> 00:00:47.483
value onto another row.

15
00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:50.838
It refuses to open. A value only opens where

16
00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:51.985
it was written.

17
00:00:54.695 --> 00:00:57.280
Netflix was saved before the change,

18
00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.799
and it opens like nothing happened.

19
00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:04.073
Rotating the master now rewraps one key per

20
00:01:04.073 --> 00:01:05.885
owner, never the secrets.
